:''Not to be confused with [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]]. For the enemy, see [[Yakisoba U.F.O. Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''U.F.O. Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] and can be unlocked by beating any stage in [[Nissin U.F.O. Collaboration Event#U.F.O. Strikes!|U.F.O. Strikes!]] during the [[Nissin U.F.O. Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 540
|rarity = RR
|name1 = U.F.O. Cat
|name2 = Yakisoba U.F.O. Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Yakisoba U.F.O. Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Although it looks like a frailier but heavier-hitting [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]] with [[Barrier Breaker]] and [[Immune to Warp]] at first, this unit also has 3x the time between attacks. Due to it being more damage over DPS oriented, this unit works better than UFO Cat against enemies that the regular UFO Cat wouldn't be able to get more than one hit on, such as [[Le'boin]] and [[Sir Seal]].

Its Barrier Breaker can be usable against groups of [[UltraBaaBaa]], but since it's just 20% chance to trigger, it shouldn't be considered reliable and more effective options are aplenty.

{{Job|Classification = Melee & Breaker}}

